          "description": "Reconstruct a 2×2 contingency table from two column-conditional percentages and a total N. Searches every (col1, col2) pair summing to n_total for ones where both percentages GRIM-pass. Optionally filters by reported chi-squared. Use when a paper gives row-percentages and a chi-squared but suppresses the cell counts. Parameters: pct_col1 (float), pct_col2 (float), n_total (int), decimals (int, default 1), value_type (str, default 'percentage'), reported_chi2 (float, optional), chi2_tolerance (float, default 0.05), balance_ratio_max (float, default 4.0)",
